  "participants": {
    "n": 612,
    "description": "Experiment I: 126 high school students (84 boys, 42 girls) from Palo Alto, California, divided into 18 groups (12 male, 6 female), half with 5 subjects, half with 9 subjects. Experiment II: 306 high school students, divided into 34 groups of 7 to 9 each (18 male, 16 female). Experiment III: 180 women between the ages of 25 and 60, recruited through a temporary employment agency, run in groups of nine.",
